   <text:p text:style-name="P62"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48"><text:span text:style-name="T26">M</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T27">oringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T38"> is exceptionally nutritious:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L2">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:list>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:p text:style-name="P47">92 nutrients including </text:p>
       <text:list>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47">vitamins</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47">minerals</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47">amino acids</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
       </text:list>
      </text:list-item>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:p text:style-name="P47">46 antioxidants</text:p>
       <text:list>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47">High protein content</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T46">A</text:span>ll essential amino acids</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47">Rich in vitamins: A, C, E, and B-complex</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47">Mineral-rich: </text:p>
         <text:list>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T14">C</text:span>alcium</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T14">I</text:span>ron</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T14">M</text:span>agnesium</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T14">Z</text:span>inc</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T14">Po</text:span>tassium</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
         </text:list>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P47">Anti-inflammatory compounds:</text:p>
         <text:list>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P47">Isothiocyanates</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P47"><text:span text:style-name="T14">F</text:span>lavonoids</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
         </text:list>
        </text:list-item>
       </text:list>
      </text:list-item>
     </text:list>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P63"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77">According to Dr. Bill Messer, <text:span text:style-name="T25">Moringa</text:span> is the most vitamin dense pla<text:span text:style-name="T1">n</text:span>t on Earth. Among its benefits:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Used to feed starving children in Africa.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Protects and nourishes skin and hair.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Edema.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Protects the Liver.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Prevents and Treats Cancer.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Intestinal Discomfort.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Fights Bacterial Diseases.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Improves Bone Health.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Mood Disoders.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Protects the Cardiovascular System.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Diabetes by Lowering Blood Sugar Levels.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Improves Asthma Symptoms.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78"><text:span text:style-name="T23"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Gives Energy—</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29">don’t take </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T30">before bed</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P81"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49"><text:span text:style-name="T23">Other benefits attributed to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T26">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23"> consuption </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T46">include</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23">:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L3">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P50">anti-diabetic</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P50">anti-cancer</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P50">anti-ulcer</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P50">anti-microbial</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P50">anti-oxidan<text:span text:style-name="T38">t</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P50"><text:span text:style-name="T38">c</text:span>urbing malnutrition</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P51">energises elderly</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73"><text:span text:style-name="T21">People are more aware about health-related issues than ever before and they are very much interested in taking healthy, nutritious food. Food which has a wide range of health benefits may prevent or cure various chronic diseases are also desired. This kind of extraordinary food is also termed as super food. Scient</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">ists</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21"> worldwide have <text:s/>identified </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">a</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21"> source of healthy and nutritious food properties.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P73"><text:span text:style-name="T21"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67"><text:span text:style-name="T12"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P82"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T44">Our Farm</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P83"><text:s text:c="4"/>• <text:span text:style-name="T46">100 </text:span>hectare (<text:span text:style-name="T46">250</text:span> acre) farm in Indonesia.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P84"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Washing by Ozone Water before drying</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P84"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Certification by USDA</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P84"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Organic Certification</text:p>
