      </office:binary-data>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15"> and Malnutrition:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P68">According to The World Hunger Project, 815 million people do not have food to sustain themselves out of 7.6 billion people of the world. Moringa is a fast growing drought-resistant tree. It is widely cultivated for the diversified use of its young seed pods and green leaves as vegetables and for medicine. It is considered as a very good supplement because of its high protein value.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P69"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span> and Cholesterol:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P68">Acccording to the National Institues of Health, Moringa leaf extract of Moringa oleifera decreased the high-fat diet-induced increases in serum, liver, and kidney cholesterol levels.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P70"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span> and Obesity:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P68">Obesity constitutes a grave health problem and rises the hazard of chronic diseases such as diabetes mellitus and cardiovascular disease. Moringa holds saponins, tannins, flavonoids, glycosides and terpenoids, all of which possess medicinal belongings. The later compounds display effective anti-oxidants, anti-carcinogenic and anti-microbial potential and they can also boost the immune system.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P68"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P74"><text:span text:style-name="T18">Using </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32">Mor</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32">inga</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"> in your home:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L4">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P52">Powder can be mixed into any sauce</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
