   <text:p text:style-name="P75"><text:span text:style-name="T47">B</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T43">enefits of </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T28">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T43">:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L8">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P79">Food products are very dense in <text:span text:style-name="T45">vitamins</text:span> for <text:span text:style-name="T45">malnourished</text:span> areas</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P79">Protect and Nourish skin and hair</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Treats Edema</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Protects the Liver</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Prevents and Treats Cancer</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Treats Intestinal Discomfort.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Fights Bacterial Diseases.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Improves Bone Health.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Treats Mood Disoders.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Protects the Cardiovascular System.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Treats Diabetes by Lowering Blood Sugar Levels.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Improves Asthma Symptoms.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Prevents Obesity with Densely Packed Vitamins</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Promotes Sexual Health</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Strong Anti-Oxidant</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Prevents Ulcers</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Releives Lower GI Distress</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Protects cells from damage</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Prevents inflamation</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Relieves pain</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80">Antimicrobial</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P80"><text:s/>Gives Energy—don’t take at night.</text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P64"/>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59"><text:span text:style-name="T41">Cautions</text:span>:</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L6">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P60">Avoid Moringa from India which may be GMO treated (non Organic) and inconsitent quality.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P60">Pregnant women should consult their doctor.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P72"><text:span text:style-name="T9">Persons using medications for high blood pressure should not combine with </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">Moringa</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P66"><text:span text:style-name="T12">Beware of non-organic and products with additives. Some green powders have very little or no actual <text:s/>Moringa.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67"><text:span text:style-name="T12"/></text:p>
